{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c3c3b24ca5d794882cd266606535e705789b4c74a005e963dc88c53b28d58f99", "ja": "（作曲家さんにお願いしていた曲が届いた。\n昴は、今日は劇場に来ているはずだな……）", "zh": "（拜托作曲家创作的歌曲送来了。\n昴今天应该会来剧场吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "7bc4789d5137b3a0fdedee32a5173c6150ce5c726fda836d5787c1bd9a8b662c", "ja": "次が兄ちゃんにとって、最後の試合なんだ！\nだからオレ、メチャクチャ盛り上げてやりたいんだよ。", "zh": "下一场比赛对哥哥来说就是最后一场了！\n所以我想让现场气氛热烈到极点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "c142b8129f8b8ec254598c249106ea86b58d58f2411e049b4c76a791858476ad", "ja": "えっ、最後……？\nそれって、引退試合ってことですか？", "zh": "诶，最后一场……？\n也就是说，这是退役赛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "a4b4b6f5581c75b7809061c21e839daa98f00c4411eec0ef808a53f95f96a8ce", "ja": "そう。一番下の兄ちゃんなんだけど、\n高校3年で、2年との追い出し試合なんだ！", "zh": "对。我最小的哥哥现在上高中3年级，要和2年级的学生打送别赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "f700f3833b22c048c82a2ad941db208280a3d760d54f2041ef955e16e6c06428", "ja": "みんなの分の弁当も、オレが作る予定だし。\n楽しみだな～、へへっ♪", "zh": "大家的便当我也打算来做。\n好期待啊～，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "b8263c9ec902370160901e045d6ea0acdf92990db10b9cced1984d19f888f305", "ja": "わぁ、昴さんの手づくりのお弁当かい？\nお兄さんも、きっとよろこぶと思うよぉ。", "zh": "哇，是昴亲手做便当吗？\n我想你哥哥也一定会很高兴的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "7813df11f188536a7f1c05403db06528c281e9d31fd45e35a739960b96328fe4", "ja": "昴さん、お料理上手って聞きました！\n食べてみたいな～♪　タコさんウィンナ～♪", "zh": "昴姐，我听说您很擅长做菜！\n好想尝尝看哦～♪ 章鱼肠～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "93c1894908e4c1e3e5a0988a3afcb802b2bacf5ce2a3852188958899cd35c46e", "ja": "そうか？　別に、普通の弁当だけど……。\n食べたいなら、今度ふたりにも作ってやるよ！", "zh": "这样啊？也没什么，就是普通的便当而已……\n你们想吃的话，下次我也做给你们俩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "f44664d036ef9cde6cda70dbd9cea00337139d23f871fcfae7f750d3fda3c068", "ja": "え、いいんですか！？　やったー♪\n昴さんのお弁当、すっごく楽しみです！", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？太好了♪\n我特别期待昴先生的便当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "2978b517615285323ab00193274803360d9658e99ad8a4bf9c9b5bf876272de1", "ja": "じゃああたしは、箸休めにお漬物を持ってくるべさ。\n田舎からもらった野菜で、あたしが漬けたんだよぉ。", "zh": "那我就带点小菜，给大家换换口味吧。\n这是用老家送来的蔬菜，我自己腌的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "1971d621fbc361d672b133a7874bd9d81a95abff65ff2ceebe22789e9100fba0", "ja": "ラッキー！\nひなたのお漬け物、ウマいんだよな～♪", "zh": "太幸运了！\n小日向腌的咸菜可好吃了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1011_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f8bba63b6ea768f2ed90a70d9054557d81442680911a08094d07236bd314885a", "ja": "お疲れさま……あ、昴、ここにいたんだな。", "zh": "辛苦了……啊，昴，原来你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "3db059844872f705aec45c27d5bc07874d3381033dcee4533b1511c1be416a96", "ja": "お疲れ、{$P$}！\nオレに何か用事？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7966b4cf80fdf771e195e6bcf5aba5d293b8ed9441ce947d1eca07ea37cb14ac", "ja": "ああ。昴の新曲が届いたんだ。次の定期公演で、\nお披露目しようと思ってるんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，昴的新歌送到了。我想着在下次定期公演上首次公开，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "0eef2b2941932021e866bb57fdc98a67ac74affbc9a97256586e42d47241fe1f", "ja": "えっ？　新曲って……オレの！？\nうわぁ、やったー！", "zh": "咦？新歌……是我的！？  \n哇——太棒啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "e37ef8ae64daa3076c0e312a5a07254991566e200368ec6c534cb6cf82d0b2f1", "ja": "それって、どんな感じの曲？\n{$P$}、あるなら聞かせてよ！", "zh": "那会是怎样的歌曲？\n{$P$}，要是有的话就放给我听听吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1d56089996367e3947d4908cffc5a1cfb540ea8cdd6da671436c76474ae87605", "ja": "よし、じゃあ聞いてみるか。\nえーと、プレイヤーは……。", "zh": "好，那就听听看吧。\n我找找，播放器在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "8d0ee9862c04a6316263809fb1329f4d680986a793138b3360bc8aaff340900e", "ja": "えっ……これ、ホントにオレの曲！？\nなんか、キュンキュンするっていうか……すっげー！", "zh": "诶……这真的是我的歌！？\n怎么说呢，感觉心里怦怦直跳……太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "27f361b86a9ee69f705e77dc75703c6db9f0d64c3f42e5249640ff42b483f0c0", "ja": "気に入ってくれたみたいでよかった。それで、\n公演なんだけど、この日を予定してるんだ。", "zh": "看起来你很喜欢，太好了。然后，关于公演，我打算安排在这一天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f11fcc537630ee308e5cf8959ce6cd7650d2c67d82524262f2217840d2bf8242", "ja": "他の仕事と劇場の予定、それから昴のレッスン期間を\n考えてのスケジュールなんだけど、どうだ？", "zh": "这是综合考虑其他工作、剧场安排，还有昴的练习时间后定下的日程，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "514a36cbc223e6e054090dce5fbeaa2f670eb922dafd9c322cf86a5a0a6c50f1", "ja": "もちろん！　しっかりレッスンして……あれ？\nこの日って、もしかして……うわあっ、やっぱり！？", "zh": "当然可以！我会好好练习的……咦？\n这天难道是……哇啊，果然是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "f5e600136d60f2bdc6b3f985c5e915f7edb4964c816a0c6b1917467b2de2ea0f", "ja": "ひえっ！？\n昴さん、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "咦！？\n昴，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "7249bd7142a30aa9e4037d5d441e7169ce3466917426704926358e74c83dcccd", "ja": "この日って、兄ちゃんの試合の日だよ！\nうわぁ、ど、どうしよ～！？", "zh": "这天是哥哥比赛的日子呀！\n呜哇，怎、怎么办呀～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "9cdf9d7d5251b1739fc504b4d7e64ede8eaba47066d0c4863e9c95b31ed3e089", "ja": "ありゃあ、困ったねぇ……。{$P$}、\nその日は昴さんのお兄さんの、引退試合があるべさ。", "zh": "哎呀，这可难办了……{$P$}，那天正好是昴先生哥哥的退部比赛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a3343fc24f5c345600fb6f7961de2600c2fed5adc56242d2a5fcffd6d9797f77", "ja": "えっ、お兄さんの部活の引退試合？\nそうか……それは、昴も応援に行きたいよな。", "zh": "咦，是哥哥社团的退役比赛？\n这样啊……昴也想去给他加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "f4ea85bb6a291744afa0f7aa437d9ba4e632831ae0472769397243469accb8fd", "ja": "う、うん……けど……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……可是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "d1c0b2cd166d6dbf30d6d0ebf5799f128fafd81c02f17c3ec22366db4fbd9d97", "ja": "{$P$}。\n公演の日にちは、ずらせないのかい？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n公演日期不能往后推吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1029_p", "source_sha256": "fcb6b44b53a353c13919456d6619d27d9198bc636d37cb9baea77e5171490316", "ja": "定期公演だから難しいな……でも、\n昴の新曲お披露目を、次の公演にする事はできるよ。", "zh": "因为是定期公演，有点难办啊……不过，\n倒是可以把昴的新歌首秀推迟到下一场公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1030_p", "source_sha256": "af40ac71774f7355decc1a86603df818ef2f1c25057114c50ec849e414775f95", "ja": "大事な用があるなら、今回は……。", "zh": "如果有要紧的事，那这次就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "7e8aa89953e0c31e1af6383c7b23d5e12af3b5f6bfa311508843329c9b5ee1b5", "ja": "た、タンマ！　えっと……{$P$}。\nちょっと、考えさせてもらっていい？", "zh": "等、等一下！那个……{$P$}。\n让我稍微考虑一下，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c8fa9f6acbd25d96df9f1a5fad5d33b5edb8fe7079f8c7a36e8f0a0e3161029d", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。\n昴の希望を尊重するからな！", "zh": "啊，当然可以。\n我会尊重昴的希望！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1034_047sub", "source_sha256": "59640af703a1ecf09d8d0385dba5d86f9f652c02576d2d7e49a6b74fa52c2141", "ja": "たっだいまー、っと。\n……ふぅ。", "zh": "我回来啦——\n……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1035_subarunoani", "source_sha256": "3a896dbd071637eae6fc38486d3739d8b6a87b26c22792fe3a917aadc093cdbd", "ja": "あ、昴？　おかえり！", "zh": "啊，昴？欢迎回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "54ef5792d802f88eef6b9a55ad3ab3e9855c6c54d0c6e78744edc21e0d4b9cf8", "ja": "わっ！？　そ、颯太兄ちゃん！\nもう帰ってたんだ。えっと……練習は？", "zh": "哇！？飒、飒太哥！\n已经回来了啊。那个……练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1037_souta", "source_sha256": "05d9496775ee9aef6aa346df8aed8a80cd6d19d491e142f07a873889aa3bb6a0", "ja": "おう、なんかメチャクチャ絶好調でさ！\nそういえば今度の試合、昴、観に来るんだろ？", "zh": "哦，感觉状态好得不得了！\n对了，下场比赛，昴会来看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1038_souta", "source_sha256": "c00276e2d4219fbe2e14f1c2d5dc2f967127937f84aa83ffca1473521f25fd31", "ja": "絶対ホームラン打つから、楽しみにしてろよ！\n昴がホームランボール、キャッチしてもいいからな♪", "zh": "我绝对会打出全垒打的，等着瞧吧！昴的全垒打球，你也可以接哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_084_1039_047sub", "source_sha256": "d0348a072425315a9ca2fd56f5e5fee9f05e0096f72047c24641c31ee0d0614c", "ja": "あ、う、うん！　すっげー楽しみ！\nあはは、はは……はは。……はぁ……。", "zh": "啊，嗯，嗯！我超期待的！\n啊哈哈，哈哈……哈哈。……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
